      "message": "I don\u0027t want to modify bh1730_convert_to_lux for kohaku.\nHere is current conditions\n        if(d_temp \u003c BH1730_LUXTH1_1K) {\n                d0_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH1_D0_1K * data0;\n                d1_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH1_D1_1K * data1;\n        } else if(d_temp \u003c BH1730_LUXTH2_1K) {\n                d0_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH2_D0_1K * data0;\n                d1_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH2_D1_1K * data1;\n        } else if(d_temp \u003c BH1730_LUXTH3_1K) {\n                d0_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH3_D0_1K * data0;\n                d1_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH3_D1_1K * data1;\n        } else if(d_temp \u003c BH1730_LUXTH4_1K) {\n                d0_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH4_D0_1K * data0;\n                d1_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH4_D1_1K * data1;\n        } else\n                return 0;\n\nTo use two condition\n * 1. d1_1K/d0_1K * 1000 \u003c  BH1730_LUXTH1_1K\n * 2. d1_1K/d0_1K * 1000 \u003e\u003d BH1730_LUXTH1_1K\n\nd1_1K/d0_1K * 1000 \u003c  BH1730_LUXTH1_1K\nd1_1K/d0_1K * 1000 \u003c  BH1730_LUXTH2_1K\n\nSo, I think we will not use following two conditions\n        } else if(d_temp \u003c BH1730_LUXTH3_1K) {\n                d0_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH3_D0_1K * data0;\n                d1_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH3_D1_1K * data1;\n        } else if(d_temp \u003c BH1730_LUXTH4_1K) {\n                d0_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH4_D0_1K * data0;\n                d1_1k \u003d BH1730_LUXTH4_D1_1K * data1;\n\nAnd then we can use two conditions.\nd1_1K/d0_1K * 1000 \u003c  BH1730_LUXTH1_1K\nBH1730_LUXTH1_1K \u003c\u003d d1_1K/d0_1K * 1000 \u003c  BH1730_LUXTH2_1K\n\nBH1730_LUXTH2_1K is maximum value for d1_1K/d0_1K * 1000\nSo, it will meet d1_1K/d0_1K * 1000 \u003e\u003d BH1730_LUXTH1_1K\n\nFrom ALS IC datasheet, we need 4 equations as light source(lux). \nBut from our test result, following two condition can get accurate lux from all range lux.\n\n * 1. d1_1K/d0_1K * 1000 \u003c  BH1730_LUXTH1_1K (270)\n * 2. d1_1K/d0_1K * 1000 \u003e\u003d BH1730_LUXTH1_1K (270)",
